          "char_start": 1000,
          "char_end": 1441,
          "text": "\"Consolidated EBITDA\" means, for any period, Consolidated Net Income for such period plus, without duplication and to the extent deducted in determining Consolidated Net Income, (a) Consolidated Interest Expense, (b) provision for taxes, (c) depreciation and amortization, (d) non-cash charges and (e) restructuring charges in an aggregate amount not to exceed 10% of Consolidated EBITDA (calculated before giving effect to this clause (e))."
